  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">애<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>졩<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">비<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">슐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">캏<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">위<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">대<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˍ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/vNloGR7mF1Y?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">倒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">도`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">佇<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">듸-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">故鄉<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">거`형ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">街市<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">괴ˉ치ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">中央<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뎡ˉ응ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    tò-ti-kòr-hiōng-koē-chī’e tiōng-n̂g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">笑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쵸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">看<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">콸`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">世界<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">세`개</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">轉踅<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">등ˆ셓ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chiò-khoà̰-sè-kai lêh-tn̂g-sêh\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì si-goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">烏暗<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">어ˉ암</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">心<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">심ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">唯一<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">위읻</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">光<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">긍ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ōr-am’e sîm wi-it’e kn̂g\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #5 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">親像<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眼前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">깐ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">燈火<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">뎽ˉ훼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-si-gân-jiéng’e tiēng-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原諒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">款<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">콴`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放蕩<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">헝`덩ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goan-liong-goâ-jît-khoàn hòng-tōng’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">原諒<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">꽌령-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">做<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">조`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"jît\">這<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">짇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">款<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">콴`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夭壽<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄋᆤˆ슈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">夢<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">빵ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goan-liong-goà jò-jît-khoàn yâu-siū’e bāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">每<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">뮈ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">一擺<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">짇배`</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">眼神<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">깐ˆ신ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">振動<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">딘ˆ당ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    mûi-jit-pài lì’e gân-sín lêh-tîn-tāng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby>허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">法<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">홛</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">分<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">분ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">西<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">새ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">東<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">당ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lông-hor-goà bo-hoat pūn-sāi-tâng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #5 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    옿\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    oh\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">用<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">영-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">人格<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">띤겧</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">保證<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">보ˆ졩</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà yong-goà’e rin-keh lai-pô-jieng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">永遠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">옝ˆ완ˆ-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">後悔<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">효훼`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà si-yêng-oân-boe-hio-huè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    lì si-goà\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">目前<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">뻑졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">為止<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">위지`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛人<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">애`띤ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">內底<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">래되`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bork-jiéng wi-jì’e ài-rín lai-toè\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #5 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    뽀<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">疑<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">끼ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">上<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">셩-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">媠<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">쉬`</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\" title=\"hît\">彼<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">힏ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">个<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">에ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    bo-gí si-siong-sùi’e hît-é\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">其實<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">기싣ˆ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby>음<ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">離開<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà ki-sît m-si-m-goan-li-khûi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">攏<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">렁ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">怪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">괘`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">行<rt style=\"font-siz